{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "917a8fba-053a-81fc-aa29-8c5e7912991b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T12:36:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, this is Theresa Mancini. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house, 5 Annandale Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 5 Annandale. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, let me start from last week. Tuesday I first noticed a smell, like a sewer smell, coming up from the drain by the curb. I figured it was the cold weather. Then the storm came Friday into Saturday, the one two days ago, and now the drain is gurgling. Actually gurgling, like somebody's running a bathtub down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling and a sewer smell. Got it, I'm writing that down. Is there water standing in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some on Saturday, it's mostly gone now. But the smell is still there. And there's a manhole cover right near it that looks off. It's sitting maybe an inch higher on one side. I don't know if a truck knocked it or what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "An inch off, okay. That one we'll want a crew to look at for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, hold on. Girls, I'm on the phone! Give her the bowl, it's the same bowl, Gianna, it's a bowl! Sorry, Kevin, the twins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Over a bowl, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Over a cereal bowl, yes. Anyway. What I want to know is when did they last come by and clean that drain? Because I've lived here a long time and I never see anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning history in front of me on this screen. I'll put in the request with the address, and the crew lead can check the last service date. Somebody can call you back with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Use this number, 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0164. So 5 Annandale, gurgling drain, sewer odor, and a manhole cover sitting about an inch off. I'll mark the cover as a safety item."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you, Kevin. I'd just like somebody to actually come out this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll get it in right now. Take care, Theresa."
    }
  ],
